~ start
Mom [#mood=smile]: I'm home!
Mom: Ayan, could you come down to the dining room, we need to talk.
Mom [#mood=default]: It's... about the text that I sent you earlier.

if GameState.fields.get("read_letter", true):
	=> confronted_read
else:
	=> confronted_unread
	
~ confronted_unread
Mom: So you didn't read the letter now, did you?
Ayan [#mood=default]: Of course not, Mom.
Ayan: I would never open it when you told me not to.
Mom [#mood=smile]: I'm glad you didn't, my son.
Mom: It's nothing but a bad omen.
Mom: It's best if you just stay away from it.
Ayan [#mood=neutral]: What do you mean, mom?
Ayan: Everything you're saying is... really confusing.
Ayan: Is there anything wrong?
Mom: Just, forget any of this ever happened, alright? It's for your own good.
Ayan [#mood=sad]: Mom... If there's anything that's bothering you...
Ayan [#mood=frown]: Then I feel like I deserve to know.
Mom [#mood=sad]: ...
Mom: I really didn't want you to get involved in this but...
Mom: I guess it's about time you knew about this.
=> reveal

~ confronted_read
Mom [#mood=neutral]: So you didn't read the letter now, did you?
Ayan [#mood=neutral]: I did, mom.
Ayan [#mood=sad]: I'm really sorry about that but... I was just... curious.
Ayan: That letter just showed up out of nowhere and I wanted to see what it was about.
Ayan: And... seeing your text made me even more worried.
Mom [#mood=sad]: I am a little disappointed. But well, I guess it was about time you knew anyway.
=> reveal


~ reveal
Ayan [#mood=neutral]: Knew what, mom?
Mom: The place mentioned in the letter... Blackwood Mansion...
Mom [#mood=sad]: You're too young to remember this but... Your father used to work there.
Mom: He left the job after only a few months and by that point he was a completely different person.
Mom: He never talked about it at all, no matter how much I pushed him.
Mom: He had just shut himself out to the world.
Mom: That is why I don't want you to go there.
Mom: That place isn't safe for you... I can't see you end up like your father.
Ayan [#mood=neutral]: But... why would they contact me now after all this time?
Ayan: What could they want with me?
Ayan [#mood=angry]: And why did you never tell me that Dad was involved with them?
Mom [#mood=frown]: All I know is that some things are better off not knowing and getting involved.
Mom [#mood=sad]: Promise me, Ayan. You have to promise me you won't go there.
- Lie about not going
	=> promise_response_lie
- Decide not to go
	=> promise_response_truth
- Decide to go there
	=> insist_response

~ promise_response_truth
do GameState.fields["next_act"] = "act_3b"
Ayan [#mood=default]: I won't go, Mom. Don't worry.
Mom [#mood=happy]: I'm so relieved. I would never want you to be in any danger.
=> END

~ promise_response_lie
do GameState.fields["lie_about_not_going"] = true
do GameState.fields["next_act"] = "act_3a"
Ayan [#mood=neutral]: (I feel kinda bad about lying to Mom). 
Ayan [#mood=default]: I won't go, Mom. Don't worry.
Mom [#mood=happy]: I'm so relieved. I would never want you to be in any danger.
=> END

~ insist_response
do GameState.fields["lie_about_not_going"] = false
do GameState.fields["next_act"] = "act_3a"
Ayan [#mood=frown]: I have to go, mom. I'm sorry.
Ayan: Don't worry about me, I'll be safe, I promise.
Mom [#mood=sad]: Please, Ayan, I beg you, don't go.
Ayan [#mood=frown]: I'm sorry, mom, but I must look for answers.
=> END